        "data": {
          "comment": "# Turn a Support Thread into a Bug Report\n\nTurns a support conversation into a bug report an engineer can act on. Anything the thread does not say is listed as missing instead of invented.\n\n**How it works:** Paste the thread into \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" writes a title, steps to reproduce, expected and actual results and environment, plus a Missing information list. \"3 Output\" returns the report.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Agent\" and paste a thread that never mentions the browser or OS to see the missing list."
